}

params:query {
  ~page: 1
  ~limit: 10
}

docs {
  # List Hibah Internal
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/hibah-internal`
  
  **Auth Required:** ❌ Public
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Query Parameters)
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Default |
  |-------|------|----------|---------|
  | page | number | ❌ | 1 |
  | limit | number | ❌ | 10 |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil daftar hibah internal",
    "data": [
      {
        "id": "uuid",
        "tipe_hibah": "Penelitian",
        "judul_hibah": "Hibah Penelitian 2024",
        "susunan_tim_hibah": ["Dr. John Doe", "Prof. Jane"],
        "tahun_hibah": "2024",
        "dana_hibah": 50000000,
        "createdAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 10,
      "total": 30,
      "totalPages": 3
    }
  }
  ```
}
